\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Choose from a variety of modules to customize both the deck and hull layer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Ceaseless from Spreading!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown element has been unleashed upon space and its spread causes everything it consumes to cease!<br>It's your job to explore the universe while visiting structures and investigating signals to make your starship as powerful as you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you feel ready or the spread of the Ceaseless becomes too great, locate and defeat the\u00a0perpetrator of the end of universe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong>\u00a0Build up your ship as you obtain new resources, discover new blueprints for parts, and extract up to 5 modules to give your ship synergistic buffs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Universe:</strong> Traverse an endless procedurally generated universe,  composed of unique combinations of environments that each have different risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate Signals:</strong>\u00a0Your radars will pick up random signals ranging from harmless mining operations to deadly ambushes. Assess these signals and decide if they are worth your resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Progress updates on my YouTube channel at Ink4112 or on the sidebar --&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401160/extras/b60ff883c84aae9b9c6082e2d307f12d.webp?t=1757885804\" width=609 height=31 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401160?t=1757885804","background_raw":"https://shared.aka